    "text": "Be \u00feam drihtenlican sunnand\u00e6g folces lar.\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, her ongin\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t \u00e6rendgewrit ures Drihtnes, middangeardes h\u00e6lendes, be \u00feam forebode\n\u00de\u00e6t awrat drihtnes engel mid his sylfes fingrum and hit sealde Petre \u00feam bisceope on \u00f0\u00e6re Antiochiscan\n\u00deillic is \u00feonne se fruma \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6rendgewrites, ic, \u00e6rendraca & boda drihtnes h\u00e6lendes Cristes, bet\u00e6ce &\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest.\n\u00de\u00e6t he on \u00feam sunnand\u00e6ge geworhte heofonas & eor\u00f0an mid eallum heofonlicum endebyrdnyssum &\nOn sunnand\u00e6g he geworhte ealle \u00fea \u00f0ing \u00fee witudlice syndon gesewene & wunia\u00f0.\nOn \u00f0am d\u00e6ge he gesceop ealra manna sawla, & on \u00f0am d\u00e6ge Crist w\u00e6s acenned \u00feisne middaneard to\n& on \u00f0am d\u00e6ge he gecyrde w\u00e6ter to wine on Chana, \u00fe\u00e6re Galileiscan byrig, & on \u00f0am d\u00e6ge God\n& on sunnand\u00e6g tosleap Iudea gesamnung & acenned wear\u00f0 seo geleaffulle gesamnung.\n& on \u00feam d\u00e6ge bi\u00f0 \u00fees middanerd geendad, & on \u00f0am d\u00e6ge God dem\u00f0 menniscum cynne.\n& \u00fea \u00f0e her rihtlice lybba\u00f0, hi gewita\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif, & \u00fea \u00f0e her on woh libba\u00f0, hi gewita\u00f0 on \u00fe\u00e6t ece\n\u00dei \u00feonne eow bebeode\u00f0 Drihten God \u00fe\u00e6t ge \u00feone sunnand\u00e6g healdan fram eallum woruldlicum\n& \u00feas \u00feing sindon eallum tidum forbodene.\n& healdon ge \u00feone sunnand\u00e6g wi\u00f0 \u00e6lce ceapunga.\nOn \u00f0am d\u00e6ge sy \u00fe\u00e6t eower \u00e6reste weorc \u00fe\u00e6t ge eow geemtigen on gebedum, & \u00fe\u00e6t ge gehyren on\n& on \u00f0an d\u00e6ge ge sceolon \u00feearfan fedan & nacode scrydan & \u00feurstigum drincas syllan &\n\u00deas \u00e6\u00f0elan weorc sint to healdenne on eallum tidum beforan Gode, \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere swi\u00feost on\nGif ge \u00feonne elles do\u00f0 butan \u00feas forespr\u00e6cenan \u00feing, \u00feonne swinge ic eow \u00feam heardostan swinglan,\n& ic eow gesylle to \u00e6l\u00feeodigra handa, & ic eow fordo & besence eow, swa ic dyde Sodoman &\n& ic eow gel\u00e6de to hergienne on \u00fea \u00f0eode \u00fee ge heora gereord ne cunnon, & hi gegripa\u00f0 ongean eow\nAnd be \u00feysum ylcan andgyte Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0, se \u00f0e of Gode bi\u00f0, he Godes word gehyr\u00f0.\n\u00dea yfelan \u00fewyran men hyt gehyra\u00f0, ac hi hyt healdan nella\u00f0, for\u00f0i\u00fee hi \u00fe\u00e6s deofles syndon, gif hi\nDrihten sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0, wite ge gewislice & on gemyndum habba\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ic fram frym\u00f0e bebead \u00feone\n& swa hwa swa \u00e6nig woruldlic weorc on sunnand\u00e6g wyrc\u00f0, o\u00f0\u00f0e hr\u00e6gel w\u00e6sce\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6nigne cr\u00e6ft\nAc for \u00fe\u00e6re bletsunge \u00fee hi forhogodon on \u00feam sunnand\u00e6ge buton yldinge wirignysse hi gemeta\u00f0.\n& ic asende on heora hiwr\u00e6dene unarimedlice untrumnysse & cwealmas, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge ofer hi ge ofer\nLa forhwi ne geman seo \u00feweore \u00feeod & seo wi\u00f0erwearde, \u00fee nu wuna\u00f0 on \u00f0\u00e6re ytemestan tide \u00feises\n& ic hi het ut al\u00e6dan on \u00feone halgan easterd\u00e6g of \u00f0\u00e6re ceastre xi si\u00f0um hundred \u00feusenda on h\u00e6ftned,\nGif ge \u00feonne on \u00feam halgan sunnand\u00e6ge on \u00e6nigum geflite standa\u00f0 o\u00f0\u00f0e on \u00e6nigum fullicum\nSo\u00f0lice, gif ge \u00feis ne healda\u00f0 \u00feone halgan sunnand\u00e6g fram eallum weorcum, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge \u00feeowe ge frige,\nAc gyf ge \u00feis forhicga\u00f0 & sacerdum ne gehyra\u00f0 & eowrum yldrum & wisum lareowum, \u00fee eow\n& ge \u00fe\u00e6t forhogia\u00f0, \u00feonne onsend ic ofer eowerne eard ysta & ligr\u00e6scas & wilde fyr on eowrum\nAnd gif ge getreowlice & rihtlice \u00fea frumsceattas eowre teo\u00feunga of eallum eowrum geswincum, o\u00f0\u00f0e\n& ic \u00f